  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to Beetroot Academy for reskilling in Ukraine 2025-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Beetroot Academy f&#xf6;r omskolningsprojekt i Ukraina 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to Beetroot Academy CF amounting to 9 914 050 SEK for provision of IT education for employees in Ukraine&#x2019;s state administration, IT sector and civil society 2025-2027. The project aims to reach 2,000 participants and result in a more efficient government, as well as growth in Ukraine&#x2019;s IT sector.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Beetroot Academy CF om 9 914 050 kronor f&#xf6;r IT-utbildning f&#xf6;r anst&#xe4;llda i Ukrainas statsf&#xf6;rvaltning, IT-sektor och civilsamh&#xe4;lle 2025-2027. Projektets m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att minst 2000 personer ska delta och att utbildningen ska resultera i en mer effektiv f&#xf6;rvaltning samt tillv&#xe4;xt i Ukrainas IT-sektor.</narrative>
  </description>
